  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather:p001:m0000" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">王晏</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather:p001:m0003" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">士彥</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAB">弘之</persName>，通直常侍。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-wangyan-father-and-grandfather:p001:m0023" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDACABB">普曜</persName>，祕書監。</p>
